  "source": "",
  "lolo": "app std-zone-card \"1.0.0\"\n\"Headless zone-guidance mechanic for side-view boards: tracks which band of the world the player is in and holds up that zone's card — name, concept, objective — for a while after every crossing. Listens BODY_MOVED and, when the player's x crosses into a different config zone, stamps the shared entity (zoneId, card, enteredAt) and emits ZONE_CHANGED carrying the card fields; the card self-clears ttlTicks BODY_MOVED ticks later (a per-move tick counter on the entity, so pauses at speed zero still age it out) and boards clear it early via CARD_DISMISS (renamed to a board-scoped progress event) on any mechanic completion. RESTART clears the card and the clock. Renders nothing; boards draw the card from the shared entity (the render authority).\"\norbital ZoneCardOrbital {\n  type ZoneCard = {\n    name : string!\n    concept : string\n    objective : string\n  }\n  type ZoneCardZone = {\n    id : string!\n    name : string!\n    concept : string\n    objective : string\n    x0 : number!\n    x1 : number!\n  }\n\n  entity ZoneCardData [runtime, shared] {\n    id : string!\n    zoneId : string = \"\"\n    card : ZoneCard\n    enteredAt : number = 0\n    ticks : number = 0\n  }\n\n  trait ZoneCard -> @rebindable ZoneCardData [lifecycle] {\n    initial: active\n\n    state active {\n      INIT -> active\n        (set @entity.zoneId \"\")\n        (set @entity.card null)\n        (set @entity.enteredAt 0)\n        (set @entity.ticks 0)\n\n      BODY_MOVED -> active when @config.running\n        (set @entity.ticks (+ @entity.ticks 1))\n        (let ((zmatch (array/filter @config.zones (fn z (and (>= @payload.x (object/get @z x0)) (< @payload.x (object/get @z x1)))))))\n        (do\n          (if (and (> (array/len @zmatch) 0) (!= @entity.zoneId (object/get (array/first @zmatch) id)))\n            (do\n              (set @entity.zoneId (object/get (array/first @zmatch) id))\n              (set @entity.card { name: (object/get (array/first @zmatch) name), concept: (object/get (array/first @zmatch) concept), objective: (object/get (array/first @zmatch) objective) })\n              (set @entity.enteredAt @entity.ticks)\n              (emit ZONE_CHANGED { id: (object/get (array/first @zmatch) id), name: (object/get (array/first @zmatch) name), concept: (object/get (array/first @zmatch) concept), objective: (object/get (array/first @zmatch) objective) }))\n            null)\n          (if (and (!= @entity.card null) (> (- @entity.ticks @entity.enteredAt) @config.ttlTicks))\n            (set @entity.card null)\n            null)))\n\n      CARD_DISMISS -> active\n        (set @entity.card null)\n\n      RESTART -> active\n        (set @entity.zoneId \"\")\n        (set @entity.card null)\n        (set @entity.enteredAt 0)\n        (set @entity.ticks 0)\n    }\n\n    emits {\n      ZONE_CHANGED -> external {\n        id : string!\n        name : string!\n        concept : string\n        objective : string\n      }\n        @description \"The player crossed into a different zone; carries the zone's card fields (name, concept, objective) so boards can swap banners/guides and hold the card up. Fires once per crossing.\"\n        @tier \"domain\"\n    }\n\n    listens {\n      BODY_MOVED { x : number!, y : number!, vx : number!, vy : number!, grounded : boolean!, skating : boolean!, speed : number! }\n      CARD_DISMISS { id : string }\n      RESTART { id : string }\n    }\n\n    config {\n      running : boolean = true\n        @label \"Running\"\n        @description \"When true, BODY_MOVED tracks the current zone and ages the card; toggle to freeze the card as-is.\"\n        @tier \"domain\"\n      zones : [ZoneCardZone] = []\n        @label \"Zones\"\n        @description \"One row per world band: id, display name, the one-line concept, the zone's objective text, and the x-range (x0..x1) the band covers.\"\n        @tier \"domain\"\n      ttlTicks : number = 120\n        @label \"TTL Ticks\"\n        @description \"BODY_MOVED ticks the card stays up after a zone crossing (≈ 4s at 30 moves/s) before it clears itself.\"\n        @tier \"domain\"\n    }\n  }\n\n  page \"/zone-card\" as ZoneCardPage -> ZoneCard\n}\n"
}